dth=\"1.2\"></circle><path d=\"M1.5 8h13M8 1.5c2 2 2 11 0 13M8 1.5c-2 2-2 11 0 13\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></path></svg><span>Distribuidor oficial Quooker en Las Palmas</span></p><div class=\"top-bar__contact\"><a href=\"mailto:info@gruponogal.com\" class=\"top-bar__link\"><svg class=\"top-bar__icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"1.5\" y=\"3.5\" width=\"13\" height=\"9\" rx=\"1\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></rect><path d=\"M1.5 4.5 8 9.5l6.5-5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></path></svg><span>info@gruponogal.com</span></a><a href=\"tel:+34928123456\" class=\"top-bar__link\"><svg class=\"top-bar__icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3.5 1.5h2l1 3.5-1.3.8a8 8 0 004.5 4.5l.8-1.3 3.5 1v2a1.5 1.5 0 01-1.6 1.5A11.5 11.5 0 012 3.1a1.5 1.5 0 011.5-1.6z\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg><span>928 123 456</span></a><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/\" class=\"top-bar__social\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Instagram\"><svg class=\"top-bar__icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></circle><rect x=\"5.5\" y=\"5.5\" width=\"5\" height=\"5\" rx=\"1.2\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></rect><circle cx=\"11.5\" cy=\"4.5\" r=\"0.75\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle></svg></a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/\" class=\"top-bar__social\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Facebook\"><svg class=\"top-bar__icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></circle><path d=\"M9 4.5H7.5a1.5 1.5 0 00-1.5 1.5V7H5v2h1v4h2.5V9H10l.5-2H8.5V6a.5.5 0 01.5-.5H9V4.5z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><header class=\"site-header\"><div class=\"container header\"><a class=\"header__logo-link\" href=\"/\"><img src=\"/images/logo.png\" alt=\"Nogal — Fabricamos tus ideas\" class=\"logo\" decoding=\"async\"/></a><nav class=\"header__nav\" aria-label=\"Navegación principal\"><a class=\"header__link\" href=\"/\">Inicio</a><a class=\"header__link\" href=\"/quooker\">Quooker</a><a class=\"header__link\" href=\"/cocinas\">Cocinas</a><a class=\"header__link\" href=\"/carpinteria\">Carpintería</a><a class=\"header__link\" href=\"/reformas\">Reformas</a><a class=\"header__link\" href=\"/proyectos\">Proyectos</a><a class=\"header__link\" href=\"/nosotros\">Nosotros</a><a class=\"header__link\" href=\"/contacto\">Contacto</a></nav><button type=\"button\" class=\"header__menu-btn\" aria-label=\"Abrir menú\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-menu\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"header__mobile-overlay\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><nav id=\"mobile-menu\" class=\"header__mobile\" aria-label=\"Navegación móvil\"><a class=\"header__mobile-link\" href=\"/\">Inicio</a><a class=\"header__mobile-link\" href=\"/quooker\">Quooker</a><a class=\"header__mobile-link\" href=\"/cocinas\">Cocinas</a><a class=\"header__mobile-link\" href=\"/carpinteria\">Carpintería</a><a class=\"header__mobile-link\" href=\"/reformas\">Reformas</a><a class=\"header__mobile-link\" href=\"/proyectos\">Proyectos</a><a class=\"header__mobile-link\" href=\"/nosotros\">Nosotros</a><a class=\"header__mobile-link\" href=\"/contacto\">Contacto</a></nav></header></div><main class=\"site-main site-main--flush\"><section class=\"quooker-hero\"><div class=\"container quooker-hero__inner\"><span class=\"quooker-hero__label label-caps\">¿Por qué Quooker?</span><h1 class=\"quooker-hero__title heading-serif\">Las <em>ventajas</em> de Quooker</h1><p class=\"quooker-hero__intro\">Los clásicos hervidores eléctricos o con silbato funcionan bien, pero cuando enumeras todas las ventajas de un grifo Quooker, no hay competencia. Esto es lo que un grifo Quooker aporta a tu hogar.</p></div></section><section class=\"quooker-advantages\" aria-label=\"Ventajas de Quooker\"><div class=\"container quooker-advantages__list\"><article class=\"quooker-advantage\"><span class=\"quooker-advantage__number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01</span><div class=\"quooker-advantage__body\"><h2 class=\"quooker-advantage__title heading-serif\">La opción<!-- --> <span class=\"quooker-advantage__highlight\">más segura</span></h2><p class=\"quooker-advantage__text\">En materia de seguridad, Quooker ofrece claras ventajas frente al hervidor tradicional gracias a sus múltiples sistemas de seguridad integrados y a estudios independientes que avalan su mayor seguridad.</p><a href=\"/quooker/seguridad\" class=\"quooker-link\">Leer más sobre seguridad<span aria-hidden=\"true\"> →</span></a></div></article><article class=\"quooker-advantage\"><span class=\"quooker-advantage__number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">02</span><div class=\"quooker-advantage__body\"><h2 class=\"quooker-advantage__title heading-serif\">Diseñado para<!-- --> <span class=\"quooker-advantage__highlight\">ahorrar tiempo</span></h2><p class=\"quooker-advantage__text\">Con Quooker, la espera es cosa del pasado. Siempre tendrás agua hirviendo al instante, filtrada, refrigerada y con gas directamente del grifo.</p></div></article><article class=\"quooker-advantage\"><span class=\"quooker-advantage__number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">03</span><div class=\"quooker-advantage__body\"><h2 class=\"quooker-advantage__title heading-serif\">Ahorra espacio<!-- --> <span class=\"quooker-advantage__highlight\">en la encimera</span></h2><p class=\"quooker-advantage__text\">¿Cocina pequeña? Con Quooker liberas espacio en la encimera.</p></div></article><article class=\"quooker-advantage\"><span class=\"quooker-advantage__number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">04</span><div class=\"quooker-advantage__body\"><h2 class=\"quooker-advantage__title heading-serif\">Una opción versátil<!-- --> <span class=\"quooker-advantage__highlight\">para el día a día</span></h2><p class=\"quooker-advantage__text\">Quooker es un electrodoméstico de cocina que puede utilizarse para una gran variedad de tareas diarias.</p><a href=\"/quooker/usos\" class=\"quooker-link\">Descubre lo que puede hacer un Quooker<span aria-hidden=\"true\"> →</span></a></div></article><article class=\"quooker-advantage\"><span class=\"quooker-advantage__number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">05</span><div class=\"quooker-advantage__body\"><h2 class=\"quooker-advantage__title heading-serif\">El mejor sabor,<!-- --> <span class=\"quooker-advantage__highlight\">directamente del grifo</span></h2><p class=\"quooker-advantage__text\">El sistema Quooker proporciona en cada uso un agua excepcionalmente fresca y de gran sabor.</p></div></article></div></section><section class=\"quooker-catalog\" id=\"coleccion\"><div class=\"container\"><header class=\"quooker-catalog__header\"><span class=\"label-caps\">Colección</span><h2 class=\"quooker-catalog__title heading-serif\">Tu cocina, tu estilo. <em>¿Qué grifo Quooker se adapta mejor a tus necesidades?</em></h2><a href=\"#coleccion\" class=\"btn btn--outline-dark\">Consulta nuestra gama completa</a></header><div class=\"product-slider\"><div class=\"product-slider__viewport\"><div class=\"product-slider__track\" style=\"transform:translate3d(-0%, 0, 0)\"><ul class=\"product-slider__slide\" aria-hidden=\"false\"><li><article class=\"product-card\"><a href=\"/productos/flex-round\" class=\"product-card__media\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img alt=\"Flex Round\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"520\" height=\"440\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"product-card__image\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fproductos%2FflexRound.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages